      "raw": "<p>There are 110 cards total in the foil collection.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Of these, 67 represent the variants. Apologies for the dificulty in reading the list below. It&#39;s shorthand, designed to be written in a small space.</p><div>Variant Heroes: 67 (YL-1, RCW-1, Ra-1, Fanatic-1, DV-1, EH-1, F6-6, DWatch-4,&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">GIL/B-2, SST-1, Prime Wardens-5, Knyfe-1, Kvothe-1,</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">TNat-3, Santa Guise-1, SI-1, HN-1, CR-1, Se-4,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Completionist-1, OU-1, Fugue-1, SSEx-3, CCI-1, VisUn-1,</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">&nbsp;Lum-1, DWHarpy-1, Sgoodguy-1, S&amp;D-1, A&#39;T-1, Como-1,</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">&nbsp;Lifeline-1, XtremePW-5, VGvariants-4, F5-5, Sunset-1)</span></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>&nbsp;</div><ul><li>A<span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">bsolute Zero, besides his main card, has his Freedom 6 version, his Termination version, and his Freedom V version, for a total of four cards.&nbsp;</span></li></ul><div>&nbsp;</div>",
